BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Davis Downtown": "https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-06-10/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:davis_downtown
SUMMARY:Picnic in the Park at Davis Farmers Market – Wednesday Evenings 
 (50th Anniversary Year)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260610T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260610T200000
UID:10000879-1781107200-1781121600@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The beloved Picnic in the Park season is back at the Davis Far
 mers Market starting Wednesday\, April 1\, 2026! \nEvery Wednesday evening
  through August 26\, the market expands to 4:00 – 8:00 PM\, turning Cent
 ral Park into the perfect spot for a relaxed picnic dinner. Shop fresh pro
 duce\, artisan goods\, and a wide variety of prepared foods from your favo
 rite vendors. Enjoy local craft beer\, wine\, and brand new this year – 
 mead! \nEach week features live music and children’s activities\, creati
 ng a festive\, family-friendly atmosphere. Bring blankets\, lawn chairs\, 
 and reusable bags. It’s the ideal way to unwind\, connect with neighbors
 \, and support local farmers and food makers. \nThis year is extra special
  as the Davis Farmers Market celebrates its 50th Anniversary! Don’t miss
  the big anniversary celebration on Saturday\, August 1\, 2026. \nNew in 2
 026: The Market Memories Cookbook (presale now at davis-farmers-market). \
 nHighlights Include: \n\nBuckhorn Food Truck\, The Hotdogger\, Dhillon Far
 m\, Davis Bread & Desserts\, Greek Table\, Kettle Pop & more\nLive music e
 very week\nKids’ activities\nLocal beer\, wine & mead\n\nFree to attend 
 – everyone is welcome!
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-
 local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-06-10/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Thedirt": "https://thedirt.online/event/davis-farmers-market-3-2/2026-06-10/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:thedirt
X-SOURCE:The Dirt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260610T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260610T200000
DTSTAMP:20260609T212059
CREATED:20260524T185843Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260524T190008Z
UID:10079842-1781107200-1781121600@thedirt.online
SUMMARY:Davis Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:Year-round at Central Park in downtown Davis\, thousands gather each week to shop for what is grown\, raised\, and made locally at our markets. We are dedicated to bringing farmers right to your table\, so we stay open rain or shine. \nWalk rows of stalls lined with an array of fruits and vegetables\, including certified organic produce\, choice meats\, chicken\, seafood\, wine\, local eggs and honey. Choose from a variety of fresh-baked goods\, plants\, flowers and gifts. Enjoy a picnic from one of our many food stands\, made from market ingredients. \nSee the vendor list here: https://www.davisfarmersmarket.org/our-sellers/ \nFarmers Market Hours  \nCentral Park: Saturdays 8a–1p (year-round)\, and Wednesdays 3p–6p (September through March); 4p–8p (April through August)\nUC Davis – North Quad: Wednesdays 10a–1:30p (fall and spring quarters)\nSutter Davis Hospital: Thursdays 10a–1p (May through September)\nSutter Medical Center\, Sacramento: Thursdays 2:30p–5:30p \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/davis-farmers-market-3-2/2026-06-10/
LOCATION:Central Park
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Food & Drink,Shopping
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/davis-farmers-market-logo-KERN-ADJUST2-01-1-e1649900473633.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Davis Farmers Market":MAILTO:dfmpr@dcn.org
END:VEVENT
