DESCRIPTION:<br><p>I’m thinking of two possible routes for the June seco
 nd Saturday ride:<u></u><u></u></p><ul><li>28 miles to a lavender farm ope
 n house: <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/55548059" target="_blank
 ">https://ridewithgps.com/<wbr />routes/55548059</a><u></u><u></u></li><li
 >Or\, 31 miles to see sunflowers: <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes
 /55548115" target="_blank">https://ridewithgps.com/<wbr />routes/55548115<
 /a><u></u><u></u></li></ul><p>Route selection will depend on the status of
  the sunflowers for the second route and rider preferences.<u></u><u></u><
 /p><p>In either case\, the plan is to start from Westlake Shopping Center 
 at 8:30 a.m.<u></u><u></u></p><p>More details below. Please let me know if
  you need additional information or have suggestions for route improvement
 s.<u></u><u></u></p><p>Thanks\,<u></u><u></u></p><p>-Anne<u></u><u></u></p
 ><p>(916) 206-2922<u></u><u></u></p><ul><li>Date: Second Saturday – June
  13\, 2026<u></u><u></u></li><li>Start time: <b>8:30</b> a.m.<u></u><u><
 /u></li><li>Start location: Westlake Shopping Center\; 1260 Lake Boulevard
 \, Davis.<u></u><u></u></li><li>Distance: 28-31 miles\, flat.<u></u><u></u
 ></li><li>Contact: Anne Huber\; <a href="mailto:anneh@dcn.org" target="_b
 lank">anneh@dcn.org</a>\; 916-206-2922<u></u><u></u></li><li>Services (Foo
 d\, water\, bathrooms): Either at the lavender farm open house or Pedrick 
 Produce<u></u><u></u></li><li>No need to RSVP<u></u><u></u></li><li>Rain c
 ancellation or postponement: communicated via the listserv.<u></u><u></u><
 /li><li>Pace: 14 - 17 mph with regroups. The speed is meant to be an indic
 ator of speed on flat terrain with no wind. People can go faster if they w
 ant as long as they are willing to regroup. There might be some stopping o
 r slowing down for scenery.<u></u><u></u></li><li>Route: <a href="https:/
 /ridewithgps.com/routes/55548115" target="_blank">https://ridewithgps.com/
 <wbr />routes/55548115</a> or <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/55
 548059" target="_blank">https://ridewithgps.com/<wbr />routes/55548059</a>
 <u></u><u></u></li></ul><p><u></u> <u></u></p><ul><li>For general informa
 tion about the second Saturday ride and bicycling with the Davis Bike Club
 \, please see: <a href="https://davisbikeclub.org/2nd-sat-explorer-ride/"
  target="_blank">https://davisbikeclub.org/2nd-<wbr />sat-explorer-ride/</
 a><u></u><u></u></li></ul><p>This link includes the following: “Cycling 
 has inherent risks. Any cyclist taking part in a DBC ride releases DBC fro
 m any liability. Guests are welcome to ride with DBC for one ride\; for su
 bsequent rides\, you must be a member of the Club. By riding with a DBC gr
 oup ride you acknowledge that you have read and understand this. Helmets a
 re required on all rides.”<u></u><u></u></p><p></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260608T140323Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Davis Bike Club
END:VEVENT
