 ploads/event/Yolo%20-%20Xiong%20%26%20Simacek_20260324182632345620.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join States Win Yolo every Monday at 2pm PT to elect Democrats
  in majority making State Legislature districts! Meet our candidates: **Ma
 i Xiong** and **Stephanie Simacek!** Reelecting **Mai Xiong** to Michigan'
 s State House District 13 is essential to building a Democratic trifecta i
